49 and 7049->4149 occur in the later subwindow (step_16 and step_06 with no early occurrence in step_11). Critically, the edges 4149->3213 and 3213->2549 happened in the earlier subwindow (step_12 and step_13), so the required chronological order along the candidate chain is broken. Windowed counts (step_14) confirm the timing distribution. Hence a cascade from 3027 to 2549 within the interval (with the \u2264600 time gap constraint) is not supported.\"\n}", "total_input_tokens": 22837, "total_output_tokens": 9926, "total_tokens": 32763, "total_latency_ms": 128655, "llm_calls": 12, "schema_repairs": 0, "tool_protocol_errors": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}